    "title": "Elkhart County Republican Party announces candidates for upcoming caucus - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Layah Gebauer ,\n8 hours ago ELKHART, Ind. -- The Elkhart County GOP has released the names of those running in the caucus on Jan. 8, 2026. Two positions are to be filled: the Concord Township Assessor and the Clerk of the Circuit Court; both of the previous officeholders, Christopher Dickinson and Christopher Anderson, resigned from their positions. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
